OL,3,AUS hits three Iranian oil tankers after
OL,4,Asaying its warships were targeted
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US military says it has hit three
OL,7,FIran-linked oil tankers in retaliation
OL,8,Ffor Tehran targeting two American
OL,9,Fwarships in the region.
OL,11,FUS Central Command (Centcom) said on
OL,12,FSaturday it had "permanently disabled"
OL,13,Ftwo tankers, including one near Kharg
OL,14,FIsland, and "completely destroyed" a
OL,15,Fthird in the Gulf of Oman.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
