OL,3,AUS hits three Iranian oil tankers after
OL,4,Asaying its warships were targeted
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran's state media confirmed the
OL,7,Fstrikes and said Tehran had launched
OL,8,Fattacks on three US-affiliated vessels
OL,9,Fin response, as well as three oil
OL,10,Ftankers travelling along an
OL,11,F"unauthorised" route through the Strait
OL,12,Fof Hormuz.
OL,14,FThe BBC has approached Centcom for
OL,15,Fcomment.
